#~ shadowed_header
# fixedbugs, defect 2344 (panel 237's compiler-engineer, a shape nobody had
# listed): `CCC_OVERRIDE_OPTIONS` adds `-include` of a file defining
# `stdbool.h`'s guard and `true` as 0, read before every unit's first line
# and every guard; `print(true)` printed `false` at exit 0.

function main()
    b = true
    print(b)
